{"mode":"normal","dialogs":[{"text":"<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Elemento neutro</strong></p>","answer":"<p style=\"text-align:center\">x(t) * δ(t) = x(t)</p>","tips":{},"image":{"path":"../../../assets/img/s15.prop_1.png","mime":"image/png","width":1200,"height":800,"copyright":{"license":"U"}},"imageAltText":"Convolución con un impulso"},{"text":"<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Desplazamiento</strong></p>","answer":"<p style=\"text-align:center\">x(t) * δ(t − t₀) = x(t − t₀); convolucionar con un impulso retrasado retrasa la señal.</p>","tips":{},"image":{"path":"../../../assets/img/s15.prop_2.png","mime":"image/png","width":1200,"height":800,"copyright":{"license":"U"}},"imageAltText":"Convolución con un impulso retrasado"},{"text":"<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Conmutativa</strong></p>","answer":"<p style=\"text-align:center\">x * h = h * x</p>","tips":{},"image":{"path":"../../../assets/img/s15.prop_3.png","mime":"image/png","width":1200,"height":800,"copyright":{"license":"U"}},"imageAltText":"Dos señales que se pueden intercambiar"},{"text":"<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Asociativa</strong></p>","answer":"<p style=\"text-align:center\">(x * h₁) * h₂ = x * (h₁ * h₂); dos sistemas en cascada equivalen a uno solo.</p>","tips":{},"image":{"path":"../../../assets/img/s15.prop_4.png","mime":"image/png","width":1200,"height":800,"copyright":{"license":"U"}},"imageAltText":"Dos sistemas en cascada"}],"behaviour":{"enableRetry":true,"disableBackwardsNavigation":false,"scaleTextNotCard":false,"randomCards":false,"maxProficiency":5,"quickProgression":false},"answer":"Voltear","next":"Siguiente","prev":"Anterior","retry":"Reintentar","correctAnswer":"¡La tuve buena!","incorrectAnswer":"La tuve mala","round":"Ronda @round","cardsLeft":"Cartas restantes: @number","nextRound":"Avanzar a ronda @round","startOver":"Comenzar de nuevo","showSummary":"Siguiente","summary":"Resumen","summaryCardsRight":"Cartas que tuvo correctas:","summaryCards